{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>下次去日本，便利店宵夜食咩好呢？跟JYP搵食啦！JYP絕對係飲食極度自律嘅娛樂圈巨頭，最近佢上咗秋成勳嘅 YouTube 節目，試食日本便利店甜品之後竟一試愛上，邊款可以令JYPapi咁失控呢？😍</p><p>JYP一共試食三款甜品，第一款係人氣OHAYO 澤西牛鮮奶布丁，表面鋪滿一層香濃鮮忌廉，極致滑嫩嘅布丁，入口滿嘴都係濃厚奶香！好識食！ 第二款係Glico 果實冰 濃郁咖啡歐蕾，將高質感咖啡配上香醇牛奶濃縮成一顆顆冰珠。入口即溶且甜而不膩，咖啡嘅微苦與奶香完美平衡，係消暑神器。 第三款FamilyMart 煙韌牛奶泡芙，呢款話題新品主打獨特嘅超Q彈煙韌外皮，咬落去口感十足；內餡仲塞滿咗質感輕盈、甜度剛好嘅鮮牛奶忌廉，一爆漿即刻滿口奶香，JYP食到停唔到！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178733608605819787_11154278366a88959a7f891.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178733609263131668_4579607166a8895a08c415.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178733609850943793_20753220526a8895a6d27cb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178733610491614799_20761370416a8895ab25282.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178733610899546715_18226341806a8895af68698.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178733611301613254_10610211036a8895b2cc9b2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178733611622389371_13788094816a8895b6c3c0a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178733612171797449_11507137396a8895bc26b5c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T18:19:56.970957+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":403,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}